nvidia-legacy-340xx-driver is a metapackage. It pulls in the runtime
libraries, the Xorg driver, the utilities, the kernel-support glue and (for the
DKMS flavour) the DKMS module source for NVIDIA 340.108.

Hardware: GeForce 8/9/200/300 series (G8x, G9x, GT2xx)
Upstream status: Upstream EOL 2019-12. Known unfixable security issues — ship with a loud warning.

To remove every trace:  apt purge '~nnvidia-legacy-340xx-.*'
